---

# Key Learnings

| Command           | Purpose                                         |
| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| `touch notes.txt` | Create an empty file                            |
| `>`               | Write data and overwrite existing content       |
| `>>`              | Append data to an existing file                 |
| `tee -a`          | Append data while displaying it on the terminal |
| `cat`             | Display the complete file                       |
| `head -n 2`       | Display the first 2 lines                       |
| `tail -n 2`       | Display the last 2 lines                        |

